Subject: [PATCH v31 10/21] mm: Introduce vm_ops->may_mprotect()
Date:   Mon,  1 Jun 2020 04:16:34 +0300
Message-Id: <20200601011645.794040-11-jarkko.sakkinen@linux.intel.com>
